<title>UK: Iran tells OPEC output at quota in May.</title>
<headline>Iran tells OPEC output at quota in May.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran told OPEC it pumped 3.595 million barrels a day (bpd) in May, the OPEC news agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The data was submitted directly to OPEC headquarters in Vienna.</p>
<p>Iran said it supplied 3.595 million bpd to market,  equal to its OPEC quota of 3.6 million bpd.</p>
<p>Production and supply data for May according to member country submissions to the OPEC Secretariat was as follows (in million bpd):</p>
<p>		Production     Supply</p>
<p>---------------------------------</p>
<p>Algeria	 0.799	   0.791</p>
<p>Indonesia     1.325	   1.280</p>
<p>Iraq	    1.489	   1.489</p>
<p>Kuwait	  2.003	   2.002</p>
<p>Libya	   1.392	   1.394</p>
<p>Nigeria	 1.870	   1.865</p>
<p>Qatar	   0.406	   0.389</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia  8.009	   8.000</p>
<p>UAE	     2.093	   2.067</p>
<p>Venezuela     2.407	   2.402</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
